      "canonical_latex": "u_{tt} = c^2 \\nabla^2 u \\text{ (Wave)},\\quad u_t = \\kappa \\nabla^2 u \\text{ (Heat)},\\quad \\nabla^2 u = 0 \\text{ (Laplace)}",
